<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><body><div class="eli-subdivision" id="art_7">
                     <p id="d1e891-1-1" class="oj-ti-art">Article 7</p>
                     <div class="eli-title" id="art_7.tit_1">
                        <p class="oj-sti-art">Conferral or limitation of rights</p>
                     </div>
                     <p class="oj-normal">The provisions in this Section concern the cooperation between supervisory authorities and do not confer rights on, or limit the rights of, individuals or the parties under investigation.</p>
                  </div>
                  </body></html>